---
import PageLayout from "../layouts/Page.astro";
---
<style>
	p {
		width: 700px;
	}

</style>
<PageLayout>
	<div class="centered">
		<h1>About Us</h1>
		<br/>
		<div class="centered" style="display: flex;">
			<p><u>We are a Sacramento-based mutual aid distro for Food Not Bombs, a non-profit organization.</u> It is as our name implies; we believe in food for all, mutual help, and community instead of war, hate, and selfish ways.</p>
		</div>
		<br/>
		<div class="centered" style="display: flex;">
			<p>We believe all people are equal and that no one should be left thirsty, starving, cold, or without medical help when we have far more than enough resources to take care of everyone in need.</p>
		</div>
		<br/>
		<div class="centered" style="display: flex;">
			<p>We are all in this together, and the world only gets better by helping each other out in any way we can from a place of genuine compassion and love for our unmet friends.</p>
		</div>
		<br/>
		<div class="centered" style="display: flex;">
			<p>Through our collective action, we wish to help create a better world for all.</p>
		</div>
		<br/>
		<div class="centered" style="display: flex;">
			<p class="centered"><a href="faqs">Click here for our FAQs!</a></p>
		</div>
	</div>
</PageLayout>
